package System
  part Data
    let x in boolean 
    let y in  { undefined }
  part

  part Fonctional 
    let x in {{ 0 }} 
  part

  part Physical
    let x in real 
  part

  requirement R1 on Data via Fonctional is
    not Data::x
  requirement

  requirement R2 on Fonctional derives R1 via Physical is
    Data::y
  requirement


  requirement R3 on Physical derives R2 is
    Data::y
  requirement

package
